-## For --watch
-
-Start a background watcher that monitors a folder and auto-updates the graph when files change.
-
-```bash
-$(cat graphify-out/.graphify_python) -m graphify.watch "$(cat graphify-out/.graphify_root)" --debounce 3
-```
